default deps = {} → `partnersStore()`, `approvalStore()`, `chancellorWorkRoot()`. In dryRun, status undefined so approvals/workRoot not touched. Good.\n\nDo I want to require openChat in the audit endpoint? It changes the endpoint from \"no durable dependency\" to resolving. Risk: openChat may throw if LLM not configured? Let me read openChat.",
