        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Good. One concern: `partnerOfSession` is called AFTER `chatKindOfSection` in persona — original checked partner BEFORE snapshot. Now snapshot then partner. If the partner store throws, original returned early (persona undefined for non-chief) — no, on throw it treated as chief. Fine content-wise.\n\nBut there's a subtle issue: persona for a non-chief partner now performs a snapshot (durable read) that could throw? `input.read.snapshot` presumably never throws (returns undefined). If it did throw, the section render would fail where previously it returned undefined early. Risk is low (same read used for other sessions). Accept, noted in change record.\n\nNow check `beforeRequest` final block."
      }
    ],
