      "text": " 920→\t\t\t\t\t},\n 921→\t\t\t\t}),\n 922→\t\t\t\t// 每次请求前：注入记忆 + 数这是本轮的第几个工具回合\n 923→\t\t\t\thook(GenerationTask, {\n 924→\t\t\t\t\tbeforeRequest: async (request, api, ctx) => {\n 925→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst lastUser = [...request.messages].reverse().find((m) => m.role === \"user\");\n 926→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst userText = lastUser ? contentText(lastUser.content) : \"\";\n 927→\n 928→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 一次模型请求 = 一个工具回合。run 一换，预算就重新算。\n 929→\t\t\t\t\t\t//\n 930→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 拿 `run.inputs[0]` 当 run 身份：run.taskId 每一轮都会变\n 931→\t\t\t\t\t\t// （每一轮是一个新的 generation 任务），用它计数永远归零，\n 932→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 上限就形同虚设 —— 这个坑是实测踩出来的。\n 933→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst live = await api.snapshot(LiveDoc, api.conversationId, ctx);\n 934→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst runId = live?.run?.inputs?.[0] ?? live?.run?.taskId;\n 935→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst key = `${api.conversationId}:${String(runId ?? \"none\")}`;\n 936→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst used = (runTurns.get(key) ?? 0) + 1;\n 937→\t\t\t\t\t\trunTurns.set(key, used);\n 938→\n 939→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 执事间递话（2026-11-08 扫尾批 8d）：把 run 身份记给通道，并认领\n 940→\t\t\t\t\t\t// \"这一轮由递话触发\"的一次性标记。认领放在这里而不是 beforeTool，\n 941→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 是因为一次模型请求对应一轮里**第一个**必到的点；mid-run 被 followUp\n 942→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 插进来的递话也在这里认领（那时 used>1，标记落到同一个 run 键上）。\n 943→\t\t\t\t\t\tbeginRelayRun(api.conversationId, key);\n 944→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (claimRelayTarget(api.conversationId)) {\n 945→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmarkRelayRun(api.conversationId, key);\n 946→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 947→\n 948→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (MAX_TURNS > 0 && used > MAX_TURNS) {\n 949→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttoolsBlocked.add(api.conversationId);\n 950→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlimitHits.set(api.conversationId, (limitHits.get(api.conversationId) ?? 0) + 1);\n 951→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(\n 952→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t`[agent] 会话 ${api.conversationId}（run ${String(live?.run?.taskId)}）工具回合达上限 ${MAX_TURNS}`,\n 953→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n 954→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (used > MAX_TURNS + HARD_STOP_GRACE && !aborting.has(key)) {\n 955→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taborting.add(key);\n 956→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(`[agent] 会话 ${api.conversationId} 无视上限，硬停这一轮`);\n 957→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvoid abortRun(api.conversationId);\n 958→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 959→\t\t\t\t\t\t} else if (used === 1) {\n 960→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 新的一轮，把上一轮封掉的工具放开\n 961→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttoolsBlocked.delete(api.conversationId);\n 962→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 防打转守卫同步清零（批次A A1）：判据按轮计，不跨轮累计\n 963→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tresetLoopGuard(api.conversationId);\n 964→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 965→\n 966→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 5 处消息注入（2026-11-10 批 27 §三）：记忆召回 / 技能斜杠 / 恢复注记 /\n 967→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 回合上限 / 执事轮上下文。框架负责排序与去重，装配处按收集结果**依次压入**，\n 968→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 位置与改造前一致（仍是本轮模型请求最前面的几条 system 消息）。\n 969→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 执事轮输入只在本轮第一次请求时算（used===1），provider 内照旧判定。\n 970→"
